5966	postgresql	query	Check foreign server ACLs for broad read access	{"sql": "SELECT s.srvname, s.srvacl::text FROM pg_foreign_server s WHERE s.srvacl IS NULL OR s.srvacl::text LIKE '%=U%'"}	{"condition": "row_count > 0", "description": "Foreign servers accessible by PUBLIC — connection details visible to all"}	\N	2026-02-25 00:28:52.405273
