6223	postgresql	query	Find peer/ident authentication entries in pg_hba.conf	{"sql": "SELECT line_number, type, database, user_name, address, auth_method FROM pg_hba_file_rules WHERE auth_method IN ('peer', 'ident')"}	{"condition": "row_count > 0", "description": "Peer/ident authentication entries found — OS-level users bypass password"}	\N	2026-02-25 00:28:52.405273
