14164	mariadb	query	Check for stored function usage in queries	{"sql": "SELECT ROUTINE_SCHEMA, ROUTINE_NAME, ROUTINE_TYPE, IS_DETERMINISTIC, SQL_DATA_ACCESS FROM information_schema.ROUTINES WHERE ROUTINE_TYPE = 'FUNCTION' AND ROUTINE_SCHEMA NOT IN ('mysql', 'sys', 'information_schema', 'performance_schema') AND IS_DETERMINISTIC = 'NO'"}	{"condition": "row_count > 0", "description": "Non-deterministic functions prevent optimizer optimizations"}	\N	2026-05-11 22:17:39.229791
