14264	mariadb	query	Find partitioned tables with indexes	{"sql": "SELECT p.TABLE_SCHEMA, p.TABLE_NAME, p.PARTITION_METHOD, p.PARTITION_EXPRESSION, COUNT(DISTINCT s.INDEX_NAME) AS index_count FROM information_schema.PARTITIONS p JOIN information_schema.STATISTICS s ON p.TABLE_SCHEMA = s.TABLE_SCHEMA AND p.TABLE_NAME = s.TABLE_NAME WHERE p.PARTITION_NAME IS NOT NULL AND p.TABLE_SCHEMA NOT IN ('mysql', 'sys', 'information_schema', 'performance_schema') GROUP BY p.TABLE_SCHEMA, p.TABLE_NAME, p.PARTITION_METHOD, p.PARTITION_EXPRESSION"}	{"condition": "row_count > 0", "description": "Partitioned tables with indexes that may not align with partition key"}	\N	2026-05-11 22:17:39.229791
